window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Laguna Grove Viper Completed Series by bestselling African American interracial romance author Jamila Jasper. If you enjoy romantic love stories between black women and white men, and appreciate diverse, multicultural romance stories, check your high-waisted compression undies at the door and take a peek inside this sizzling completed trilogy boxed set with three steamy BWWM romance novels.<br> <br> <b>Varsity Servant</b></p> <p><i>Get on your knees, or I’ll tell everyone your secret…</i></p> <p>A brute on the ice and a beast in the bedroom,</p> <p>Cole Seabrook needs a new campus servant and he’s found the perfect woman.</p> <p>Kya Ambrose. She’s African American, curvy, beautiful, and 100% disinterested in chauvinistic hockey players.</p> <p>Cole has exactly what he needs to blackmail and keep Kya under his <b>firm control.</b></p> <p>She <b>must</b> obey all his commands… <i>no matter how depraved.</i></p> <p>The only thing Cole can’t force her to do is fall in love.</p> <p><b>Varsity House Pet</b></p> <p><i>Only good girls get to sleep in my bed.</i></p> <p>Getting laid before the big game should be easy.</p> <p>Chicks at Laguna Grove dig hockey players…</p> <p>Except the one woman Jayce wants.</p> <p>His African American lab partner, Makeba Winston.</p> <p>It’s nothing he can’t solve with tequila, a thick leather leash, and a pillow at the foot of his bed.</p> <p>Makeba won’t become his girlfriend right away, but a few days tied to the bed ought to change her mind…</p> <p>Right?</p> <p><b>Varsity Property</b></p> <p>She agreed to help a friend and ended up here…</p> <p>Traded to Dustin Rathbone, a sociopathic campus hockey player whose brute instincts make him want to use her supple body in every way.</p> <p>Dustin is fifteen times hotter than he is intelligent.</p> <p>And Raven’s a straight A student, consistently at the top of the class.</p> <p>Maybe there’s a way for her to buy her freedom…</p> <p><b>Each steamy story is over 70k+ words and perfect for listeners obsessed with bingeing dark romance stories.</b></p>"; 
